      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "even 是常考单词，所以学生一定要掌握以下这些词语的用法："
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p2",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "even, much, far, still, a bit, a little, a lot 等词语可以修饰比较级，如：a bit bigger, much better, far more useful, even earlier, still greater, a little longer。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p3",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "例如：Don’t you think traveling by train is "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "much cheaper"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " and "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "far more enjoyable than"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " a trip by air? 你不认为坐火车旅行比坐飞机旅行更便宜、更愉快吗？"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
